# Line endings stay LF in every checkout, including on Windows, where Git
# converts text to CRLF by default. Nearly everything here runs in a Linux
# container or under a POSIX shell: a CRLF entrypoint.sh fails in the image
# ("#!/bin/sh\r"), and CRLF breaks shell scripts, Makefiles and the agent's
# factory file. Checked by .github/workflows/windows.yml.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.so binary
